{"ID":"20230926144959-aexosum","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230926144959-aexosum","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926144959-aexosum\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926145002-kb3xnp3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926145002-zfe6dto\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926145002-zfe6dto\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:37,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:37\u0026#125;","title":"【百合洗方】","type":"doc","updated":"20230926145002"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230926145002-kb3xnp3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926145002-kb3xnp3","updated":"20230926145002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：百合一升"}]},{"ID":"20230926145002-lsz11fx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926145002-lsz11fx","updated":"20230926145002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右一味，以水一斗，渍之一宿，以洗身。洗已，食煮饼，勿以盐鼓也。"}]},{"ID":"20230926145002-zfe6dto","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926145002-zfe6dto","updated":"20230926145002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【13.6】百合病一月不解，变成渴者，百合洗方主之。不差，栝蒌牡蛎散主之。"}]}]}